            "review_title": "Review at Coastal Saigon",
            "review_text": "MylanroseNguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam\n242 contributions\n0\nGreat View with Fantastic Dinner at Coastal Saigon.\nJul 2025 • Couples\nWe went to Coastal Saigon, one evening. What a good supprise we had. Foods was so fresh & so tasty with very nice presentation specially the seafoods. Fresh oysters were so yummy, i could not stop myseft - i had one and haft dozen. Scallops were so good as well as the Sirloin Steak. Great service with a smile on every time we asked for something. We enjoy it so much. Can stop to book a return tomorrow evening. I recommend you try one time there !!!\nWritten July 10, 2025\nVintage Collection\nWhat a truly wonderful review, thank you so much! We're absolutely thrilled you enjoyed contemporary cuisine quality & presentation, and our team's service so much.\n\nWe're so excited to welcome you back and explore our recently launched new menu too. We think you'll discover even more to love!\n\nSee you very soon at Coastal!\nRead more\nWritten July 22, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
